# Static cosign signing key material MUST never be committed. Only the
# public half (cosign.pub, tracked in the repo root) is a source artifact.
# The private key is generated and stored outside this repo entirely; these
# patterns are defense-in-depth in case it is ever generated inside the
# working tree by mistake.
cosign.key
*.cosign.key
